<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cadenalco downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cadenalco downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said on Monday it had reduced its rating for Colombian retailer Gran Cadena Almacenes Colombianos SA, or Cadenalco, to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Rue Swabey wrote that Cadenalco's downgrade was caused by &quot;increased debt and uncertainty regarding the financing of its new expansion plan.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cadenalco reported a 98 percent drop in earnings per ordinary share in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
